    "citadelle-vault/Citadelle/02-Architecture/adr/ADR-20260527-Stack-Familiarite-Trois-Temps.md",
    "citadelle-vault/Citadelle/02-Architecture/modules/Micro-Conversation-Delestage.md",
    "citadelle-vault/Citadelle/04-Operations/procedures/Playbook-Micro-Delestage-Conversationnel.md",
